      "content": "u guys are always so dramatic lol. my doctor told me last year that migraines can cause all sorts of weird sensations so i'm pretty sure it's just an aura combo. if i just take some extra triptans and a couple ibuprofen i can probably just sleep it off. honestly i just dont want to deal with an ambulance or hospital bills. is it really that likely to be a stroke? it feels more like just a really intense headache.",
